From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: n0madic <800462+n0madic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:28:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Kernel: thread-call results, sceDmaRecvN and the runtime
 memory layout

Former patches of the series, merged:
- 0003: EE thread priority fixes
- 0064: Kernel: SuspendThread, ResumeThread and WakeupThread return the thread id
- 0050: Implement sceDmaRecvN as a normal-mode transfer into memory
- 0051: Keep runtime-owned guest memory out of user RAM; heap up to the stack
